    {
      "title": "16 · Error handler: 500",
      "description": "**What happens:** Express 5 forwards the rejected promise to the error handler, which logs it and returns a generic body:\n\n```http\nHTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error\n\n{\"error\":\"internal error\"}\n```\n(derived from code, not run)",
      "file": "src/app.js",
      "pattern": "(res\\.status\\(500\\)\\.json\\(\\{ error: 'internal error' \\}\\))",
